<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>
<span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance against jailbreaking methods</span>
We report the attack success rate of Llama-3.1-8B Instruct and Qwen2.5-7B Instruct against jailbreak eight attack methods from EasyJailbreak <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib79" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhou et al. (2024b)</a></cite>.
</figcaption>
</figure>
